        <mxCell id="GN4JPHmHjAn--VAfo3RY-12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="THE ALGORITHM:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Each assignment will be given a &quot;point&quot; value where a higher point value = more urgency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;100(-(a-24)/a + 1)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;+ 5(sqrt(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;b))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;where a = Hours from due date and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;b = minutes it takes to do the assignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ex: An assignment due in 48 hours that takes 60 minutes to complete:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;100(-(48-24)/48 + 1) + 5(sqrt(60)) = 88.73 points&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ex2: An assignment due in 72 hours that takes 180 minutes to complete: 100.42 points&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ex3: An assignment due in 18 hours that takes 40 minutes to complete: 164.96 points&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="210" x="-350" y="-60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
